    schema:datePosted "2026-09-01"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "About BJAK The original mission of BJAK is we believe people deserve smarter ways to plan, save and grow their money. This is the origin of our name. Started in 2019, we built the first mobile-first, insurance platform, enabling insurance to be accessible online by millions in the region. Today, its the leading insurance platform in Southeast Asia. Today, we are expanding ways to help people in the region — this includes spending, saving, investing, exchanging, travelling, and more. Our mission is help people get more from their money every day. We have teams working around the world, with over 20 nationalities from our offices and remotely, who truly enjoys their work. We are looking for the most talented and driven people we can find. We are looking for people who work for their passion, not counting hours. Who loves building great next-generation products, not status quo. Who cares about redefining how everyone around us can get the best financial applications, not for an exclusive few. If you're this person, we'd love to talk to you. About the Role The CEO - AI Finance will build and own our AI-native finance business. The role will identify where AI can fundamentally improve how consumers manage money and build products across spending, saving, investing and other everyday financial needs. What you will be doing Define the AI Finance product strategy, roadmap and business model. Identify financial workflows where AI can materially improve the user experience, cost or speed. Build AI-native financial products from concept through launch and scale. Own P&L, customer growth, revenue, unit economics and operating performance. Work deeply with product, engineering and AI teams on product capabilities and user experience. Build the core team across product, technology, operations and commercial functions. Expand into new financial products and markets as the business scales. What you will need Strong experience building consumer fintech, financial services or technology products. Direct ownership of a meaningful product, business or P&L. Strong understanding of consumer finance, business models and unit economics. Strong product judgement and understanding of how AI can change existing financial workflows. Experience building products and teams in high-growth technology environments. Hands-on operating style - able to work directly through product, AI capabilities, economics and customer problems. Location This is a hybrid role. You are expected to work from our local office at least 3 days per week, with the remaining days offering flexibility to work remotely. Candidates should be based in, or able to work from, the location where the role is advertised. Language English is our main working language across global teams. Strong English communication is required. Interview Process Our process is designed to move fast: 1. Online assessment or practical task 2. Role-specific interview 3. CEO / final round For strong candidates, we aim to complete the process and make an offer within 1 week from the start of the interview process. Candidates who complete assessments quickly will be prioritized. Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
