    schema:description "About ActAI There are over 5 billion users using basic applications today such email, notes, tasks, calendar and they're not AI-native. Our mission is to build proactive applications for anyone in the world, who are not used to complex prompting. We aim to bring intelligence to conversations, errands, organising and workflows, with minimal to no prompting. Our product focuses on achieving high reliability for long-running workflows, persistent context, and real-world task completion. We believe products will greatly reduce hallucinations. Our objective is to organise anyone's life, allowing us all to spend time on valuable and meaningful things About the Role The CEO - AI Finance will build and own our AI-native finance business. The role will identify where AI can fundamentally improve how consumers manage money and build products across spending, saving, investing and other everyday financial needs. What you will be doing Define the AI Finance product strategy, roadmap and business model. Identify financial workflows where AI can materially improve the user experience, cost or speed. Build AI-native financial products from concept through launch and scale. Own P&L, customer growth, revenue, unit economics and operating performance. Work deeply with product, engineering and AI teams on product capabilities and user experience. Build the core team across product, technology, operations and commercial functions. Expand into new financial products and markets as the business scales. What you will need Strong experience building consumer fintech, financial services or technology products. Direct ownership of a meaningful product, business or P&L. Strong understanding of consumer finance, business models and unit economics. Strong product judgement and understanding of how AI can change existing financial workflows. Experience building products and teams in high-growth technology environments. Hands-on operating style - able to work directly through product, AI capabilities, economics and customer problems. Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
