    schema:description "About ActAI There are over 5 billion users using basic applications today such email, notes, tasks, calendar and they're not AI-native. Our mission is to build proactive applications for anyone in the world, who are not used to complex prompting. We aim to bring intelligence to conversations, errands, organising and workflows, with minimal to no prompting. Our product focuses on achieving high reliability for long-running workflows, persistent context, and real-world task completion. We believe products will greatly reduce hallucinations. Our objective is to organise anyone's life, allowing us all to spend time on valuable and meaningful things About the Role The CEO - AI Investing will build and own an AI-native consumer investing business. The role will use AI to help users understand markets, make better investment decisions and manage their portfolios. What you will be doing Define the AI Investing proposition, product roadmap and business model. Build AI-native experiences across investment discovery, research, portfolio management and decision-making. Develop how AI should analyse information, surface opportunities and support users throughout the investment journey. Own P&L, assets, customers, engagement, revenue and unit economics. Work deeply with product, engineering and AI teams to build and improve the product. Build the core investing, product, technology and commercial teams. Expand into additional investment products and markets. What you will need Deep experience in investing, wealthtech, consumer fintech or investment products. Direct ownership of a meaningful investing product, business or P&L. Strong understanding of investment products, markets and consumer investing behaviour. Strong product judgement and understanding of how AI can improve investment research and decision-making. Experience building and scaling consumer technology products. Hands-on operating capability. Able to work directly through product, investment workflows, economics and customer behaviour. Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
