    schema:datePosted "2026-09-01"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p></p> <p><strong><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">About THG Ingenuity</span></strong></p> <p>THG Ingenuity is a fully integrated digital commerce ecosystem, designed to power brands without limits. Our global end-to-end tech platform is comprised of three products: THG Commerce, THG Studios, THG Fulfilment.&nbsp;</p> <p>Each represents a single, unified solution, overcoming challenges and taking brands direct-to-consumer. Our client portfolio includes globally recognised brands such as Coca-Cola, Nestle, Elemis, Homebase, and Proctor &amp; Gamble.</p></div><p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Database Platform Manager</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:200}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Company:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">THG Ingenuity&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Location:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Manchester (Head Office)</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Reports to:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Director of Data &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Role Overview</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:320,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335572079&quot;:6,&quot;335572080&quot;:4,&quot;335572081&quot;:12566463,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;single&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">We are looking for a strong technical leader to run our database platform.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:120}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Our estate runs on Google Cloud Platform following a recent migration to self-managed services, and there is a real opportunity here to shape the next phase. How we consolidate and modernise the estate, where managed and cloud-native services earn their place, which new technologies are worth adopting, and how the platform scales with the business are all live questions. You will lead the thinking on them and work with stakeholders across the business to agree and deliver the roadmap.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:120}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">You will lead our DBA team, who own every database across the group regardless of the application running on it and who run the platform as a 24/7 service. You will work hand in hand with our Data Reliability Engineering team, whose Principal Engineer is your peer and whose focus is automation, fleet reliability and SLOs.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:120}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">This role is weighted toward hands-on technical depth. You should be as credible in a design review or an incident bridge as you are in a planning session with senior stakeholders.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:120}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Key Responsibilities</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:320,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335572079&quot;:6,&quot;335572080&quot;:4,&quot;335572081&quot;:12566463,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;single&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Technical direction</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">The technical roadmap for the estate. We want someone genuinely interested in emerging database technologies who evaluates them on merit and can articulate the pros and cons clearly to a technical or non-technical audience</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Own the strategy and delivery of the consolidation and modernisation programme across the estate, including sequencing, risk and making the case to the business</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Shape the direction of the platform and the team around two priorities, high resiliency and cost effectiveness, making the trade-offs explicit and building stakeholder consensus behind them</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Target architecture on GCP: where self-managed instances remain right and where managed and cloud-native services earn their place</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Standards for database design, performance, high availability and disaster recovery, patching, and backup and recovery</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Senior escalation&nbsp;point&nbsp;for complex L3 work: performance and query tuning, replication and failover, major incident response and post-incident review</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Automation, infrastructure as code and database CI/CD, with everything in GitHub under proper change management, so routine change scales without scaling headcount</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Team leadership</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Line management of the DBA team across the UK and India: 1:1s, development, performance, hiring and onboarding</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">The L1/L2/L3 operating model and the rotas that support it, including on-call, run sustainably and held as data rather than tribal knowledge</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Growing technical depth across the team through design review, pairing and deliberate development</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Working as a close peer to the Principal Data Reliability Engineer, with both teams operating together on automation, reliability and incident response</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Planning and stakeholders</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Capacity and allocation planning for the team, and the trade-offs when demand exceeds supply</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"13\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Weekly status and RAG reporting to senior leadership, and representing the platform in cross-functional forums</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"14\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Agreeing modernisation priorities with stakeholders and sequencing them realistically alongside run commitments</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"15\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Input into GCP cost forecasting and&nbsp;run-rate, and day-to-day management of vendor and cloud partner relationships</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Skills and Experience</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:320,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335572079&quot;:6,&quot;335572080&quot;:4,&quot;335572081&quot;:12566463,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;single&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"16\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">PostgreSQL (core requirement):</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;deep, current, hands-on expertise covering performance tuning, replication, high availability and failover, upgrades, backup and point-in-time recovery</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"17\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Microsoft SQL Server:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;strong administration experience including Always On availability groups, clustering, query tuning and maintenance</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"18\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Migration between platforms:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;practical experience moving production workloads between database engines, including schema and code conversion, data migration and cutover</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"19\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">SQL:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;able to write and optimise complex queries and diagnose execution plans first-hand</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"20\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Google Cloud Platform:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;production database workloads in GCP (Compute Engine, Cloud SQL, persistent storage, networking, IAM), and a clear view of the trade-offs between self-managed and managed services</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"21\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">On-premise&nbsp;infrastructure:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;servers, storage, networking and virtualisation, and the realities of a hybrid estate</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"22\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">GitHub, CI/CD and change management:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;everything in source control, automated pipelines for database change, and a disciplined approach to change control in a production environment</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"23\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">24/7 service ownership:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;on-call, incident and problem management, SLAs, post-incident review</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"24\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Technology evaluation and influence:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;assessing new database technologies objectively and making a clear, evidence-based case to technical and non-technical stakeholders, balancing resilience against cost</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"25\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Line management</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;in an infrastructure, DBA or SRE context</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"26\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Capacity planning and reporting</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;into senior leadership</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Desirable</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"27\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Couchbase</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;or comparable NoSQL / document-store experience</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"28\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">CockroachDB</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;or other distributed SQL platforms</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"29\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Automation and&nbsp;IaC:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;Terraform, Ansible, Python / PowerShell / Bash</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"30\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Database CI/CD tooling:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;Flyway, Liquibase or Redgate</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"31\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Database observability:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;Prometheus, Grafana, Cloud Monitoring or equivalent</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"32\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Kafka or streaming platforms</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"33\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Managing distributed or offshore teams</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"34\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Regulated or high-availability environments</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;[sector, if relevant]</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">You as a Person</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:320,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335572079&quot;:6,&quot;335572080&quot;:4,&quot;335572081&quot;:12566463,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;single&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"35\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">You are curious about technology and restless with the status quo.</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;You keep an eye on where the database world is going, form a view, and are willing to argue for change when the current approach has stopped being the right one</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"36\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">You challenge constructively.</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;You are comfortable disagreeing with a decision, including one of your own, and you do it with evidence and without making it personal</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"37\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">You give people room to grow.</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;We have a culture that supports people stretching beyond their job description, and you create that space for your team rather than defending boundaries</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"38\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">You are pragmatic about trade-offs.</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;You can hold resilience, cost and delivery pressure in the same conversation and make a defensible call rather than an idealistic one</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"39\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">You communicate well with people who are not database engineers.</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;You can take a complex technical trade-off and make it land with a stakeholder who needs to&nbsp;make a decision, not a lecture</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"40\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">You lead from the front.</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;You are hands-on by instinct, and your team see you in the detail with them, particularly when things are going wrong</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:259,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"41\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">You take on-call seriously as a human problem, not just a rota.</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;Sustainable,&nbsp;fairly shared, and something people are supported through</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><strong>THG Ingenuity is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.</strong></p> <p><strong>THG Ingenuity is committed to creating a diverse &amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.</strong></p> <p><strong>Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven't heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG Ingenuity please contact one of our <span class=\"mark75xs2u5gf\" data-markjs=\"true\" data-ogac=\"\" data-ogab=\"\" data-ogsc=\"\" data-ogsb=\"\">Talent</span> team to discuss further.</strong></p> <p>&nbsp;</p></div> Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
