    kgjobs:sourceOccurrence <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/jobs/live/occurrence/arbeitnow-product-manager-network-london-437757/1> ;
    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "product-manager-network-london-437757" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-09-01"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><strong>Welcome to the future of cloud networking and security!&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p> <p><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Cato Networks is the first company to converge enterprise networking and security into one centralized and global service that is delivered by cloud. It is led by networking and security pioneer Shlomo Kramer (Check Point, Imperva) and early investor (Palo Alto Networks, Exabeam, Trusteer and more). Cato’s unique technology inspired a brand-new product category, later named “SASE” by Gartner and a market expected to reach $28.5 billion by 2028.<br><br>This is your opportunity to get on the rocket ship and join a company that is building a cutting-edge enterprise network and secure cloud platform, and is on a fast track to becoming the worldwide market leader – don’t miss it!</span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p></div><div class=\"p-rich_text_section\"> <div class=\"p-rich_text_section\">Cato Networks is the world’s leading SASE platform, transforming how enterprises connect and secure their branches, users, and clouds. Our Product Managers are&nbsp;strategic leaders who shape the market, solve complex problems, and drive innovation across our Networking portfolio, including Cloud Connectivity, Private Access, SSE, and SD-WAN.&nbsp;<br>We are looking for a&nbsp;Network Product Manager&nbsp;to help define product strategy, collaborate with the field, and deliver impactful features that move the business forward.</div> <div class=\"p-rich_text_section\">&nbsp;</div> <div class=\"p-rich_text_section\"><strong>What You’ll Do</strong></div> <ul class=\"p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested\" data-stringify-type=\"unordered-list\" data-list-tree=\"true\" data-indent=\"0\" data-border=\"0\"> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Lead product initiatives that shape the future of enterprise networking.</li> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Work closely with customers, partners, Sales, and R&amp;D to define and deliver new capabilities.</li> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Translate strategic goals into clear product requirements and drive execution across engineering teams.</li> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Serve as a trusted expert to the field, supporting strategic deals and providing architectural guidance.</li> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Conduct market and competitive research to identify opportunities and influence roadmap decisions.</li> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Present product updates, best practices, and value propositions internally and externally.</li> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Travel periodically to meet customers and partners.</li> </ul> <div class=\"p-rich_text_section\"><strong>What You Bring</strong></div> <ul class=\"p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested\" data-stringify-type=\"unordered-list\" data-list-tree=\"true\" data-indent=\"0\" data-border=\"0\"> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">3+ years of B2B Product Management experience.</li> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Strong technical background in enterprise networking and network security.</li> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Excellent problem-solving skills and ability to support complex pre/post-sales scenarios.</li> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Leadership qualities with the ability to influence cross-functional teams.</li> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Experience or familiarity with&nbsp;SASE/SSE, SD-WAN, cloud networking, or security&nbsp;— a strong advantage.</li> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Relevant certifications (CCNP/CCIE/JNCIE) — an advantage.</li> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Background in QA, Sales Engineering, or similar networking roles — an advantage.</li> <li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">Deep knowledge of the top four Cloud Service Providers&nbsp;(Azure, AWS, GCP, OCI)&nbsp;— advantage.</li> </ul> </div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
