    schema:description "This isn’t your regular job. Almedia is a place where those who want to push harder can accelerate their careers faster than anywhere else. We’re aiming to become Germany’s second bootstrapped unicorn. Almedia is already Europe’s #3 fastest-growing company in 2025 (FT1000). We are building the future of marketing by rewarding our community of over 70 million users for engaging with our advertisers’ products. We are offering a new way to acquire users for the biggest companies in the world. We’re looking for a Working Student (20 hours/week, 6-month contract) to support our creative team with day-to-day design production. What You'll Do 🎯 Create and update presentation decks in Figma Design creative assets such as stickers, banners, statics and merch etc. Build interactive playable ads with our playable system Adapt existing designs, copy, and graphics into new formats, fix broken designs, update files etc. Support ongoing creative projects with reliable, high-quality execution What You'll Bring 💡 A strong visual eye and good design taste Experience with at least one of: Figma, Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, or Canva Willingness to learn Figma if it is not yet your primary tool Experience creating presentation decks Ability to work carefully with layouts, branding, and data visualisation Independent, structured, and reliable way of working What Makes You a Great Fit 🌟 Experience with advertising creatives, game ads, or interactive formats Familiarity with AI design tools (Higgsfield, Magnific, Openart etc.) Why Almedia? 🎁 Own Our Growth: We offer all Berlin-based employees equity in Almedia to truly be a part of our success. Scale With Almedia: Grow alongside a startup that has been profitable from day one. Central Berlin Office: Work from a fully-stocked modern office built for collaboration, accessible from all around Berlin. Other Benefits: Transport subsidy, breakfasts and lunches, language learning, Urban Sports Club, and more. We believe in fostering talent, evaluating all skill levels during the hiring process, and providing a clear path for growth. Almedia is an equal opportunity employer. We embrace and celebrate diversity, and encourage individuals from all backgrounds to apply. Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
