    schema:datePosted "2026-09-02"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "🎤 Why voize? Because we’re more than just a job! voize is building AI companions for Europe's nurses - today, 200,000+ users rely on us every shift, and we're just getting started. We're a Berlin-based scaleup with $50M in Series A backing and the ambition to match, built by a team that cares. If you're driven, want to contribute to real impact, and thrive in an environment that moves quickly, we'd love to meet you. 💡 Your Mission: Improve our French AI! In your role as Language Specialist for UK English you will: Support the development of AI companions for UK nurses with your language and cultural expertise 🚀 Your Daily Business Ensuring data quality (voice input, text data) through regular review, error correction, and dataset updates Providing localization work for UK English Analyzing data and identifying patterns Sharing knowledge and insights within the team including the differences of UK English from other English varieties Coordinating and collaborating with the development team to analyze and resolve data-related issues 🤝 Your Skillset – What you bring to the table Pursuing studies in relevant fields such as Language, Literature, Nursing, Biology, or Medicine Knowledge and interest for health care topics Business Fluent English (C2) in both spoken and written form, with a deep understanding of cultural intricacies A focused and accurate approach to working with text, with a willingness to handle repetitive tasks Excellent team spirit and enjoyment of working in an interdisciplinary environment You are self-driven, motivated, reliable, and have good time management skills You are enrolled at a German university and available to work 20 hours per week 🌱 Growing together - what you can expect at voize Flexible working hours because you know when you work best! 25 days of vacation – and your birthday off ✨ Ready to talk? Apply now! 🚀 Intro Call with our Teamlead Data (30min) – An informal conversation about you, your motivation, and how we work at voize Take Home Exercise (max. 1h) - You’ll gain an understanding of the team’s daily business Expertise Deep Dive (45min) – We talk about your expertise and how you can contribute to what we are building at voize Compensation: €16 per hour Student • Hourly Rate €16 per hour Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
