    schema:datePosted "2026-09-01"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "About the Role Playson is on the lookout for an exceptional Senior 2D Artist to transform our gaming visions into stunning realities. Key Responsibilities Participate in mood boards, brainstorming sessions, and market trend analysis to spark new projects. Our innovative projects ensure your work remains fresh and exciting Design game symbols, characters, and promotional materials, ensuring our art leads the market Refine and perfect artwork based on team and stakeholder feedback. The inspiring environment means our games set trends that others follow Prepare 2D artworks for animation, ensuring smooth transitions from static images to dynamic visuals Be an active part of the Playson Art Community, sharing ideas and inspiration. We encourage continuous growth through access to the latest tools, courses, and training for your professional development Grow not just visual quality, but also product thinking that directly supports business impact Requirements Over 5 years as a professional 2D Artist in the slots game industry Proficiency with Photoshop and similar raster graphics applications, experience with 3d as a bonus Strong understanding of colour theory, composition, lighting, anatomy, and diverse art styles. Classical art education is a plus, as it provides a solid foundation in these principles Take charge of your creative process and work closely with like-minded professionals. Your skills in conceptualising and creating captivating visuals will be key to our projects, allowing you to make a significant impact We value senior employees who bring solutions, communicate effectively, and engage in candid discussions, maintaining transparency and a positive team atmosphere Excellent collaboration skills, providing and receiving constructive feedback. Our open and proactive culture means we're always ready for new ideas and changes As a senior artist, you’ll not just execute tasks but own the process, bringing a product-focused approach to all your work. You'll have the opportunity to hear the continuous feedback from domain experts and convert it into a strong product What we Offer Benefit from a transparent and systematic quarterly bonus system We offer a flexible work schedule to accommodate your needs Choose to work remotely, providing greater flexibility and comfort Enjoy unlimited paid vacation leave, including bank holidays Take unlimited paid sick leave whenever necessary Get reimbursement for professional development courses and training. We provide access to the latest tools and training for continuous growth Recruitment Process Portfolio review. Applications without a portfolio will not be considered for further steps HR Interview Take home task Final interview By submitting your application, you acknowledge that your personal data will be processed in accordance with our Privacy Policy." ;
